source code history
#
2006-02-15 dfs

2006-03-15 dfs mpi

2006. 09. 03

- remove SW99update and ALB4 options --> SWRMDC
- SWRMDC option reads the more opack aerosol data and
  includes all options for iswsrc (1:5) = 1
- RA2 options use rinsur2 option ( reads gsfc aerosol data
  and use the single albedo iswsrc = 1, 0, 0, 1, 1

2007-10-1
   codes are converted to F90 free form
2007-11-24
   The DFS grid arrangement changed
      - start from North Pole
      - For MPI, all PEs have N.H and S.H pair grid.
      - But pair grids are arranged at opposite side.
2009-12-01
   GRIMS Renaming (GSM)
2009-12-10
   add OMLWRF
2010-01-07
   GRIMS Renaming (RSM)
2010-01-11
   End of Renaming (RSM)
2010-01-12
   replace sigma coord. with pres_cord
2010-07-14
   remove common blocks related to model configuration (resolution, mpi etc)
    => common block -> module allocate, allocatable with parameters in
       paramodel.F90.
       all common block variables are initialized as zeros
       handling common block variables with index is disassembled
       dimension is defined in the namelist that is read in the paramodel.F90
       users do not have to compile to change the dimension of model system
   configure-model cpp and compile, rescon is moved to run
   configure-scr   resolution related configuration, generate namelist and run
   debugged and cleaned up (kgwdo, gwdc, viclsm)

2010-12-09
   bug fixed for seaicetm.F90, sas.F90, kimarakawa.F90
   cleaned up for physis-main-solver.F90, sas.F90, kagwd.F90
   CONDENS == > EXPLICIT_CLOUDINESS

2011-06-04
    physcis testings and version setup
    ntrac= 2, o3 predction produces widespread rain ( do not turn it on )
    ncep scv -- widespread precip
    v3.0.h : same as in the previous but corrections in lsm and pbl for numerical stability
    v3.1.h : + CMT + modified YSU (NEW_Z1) + OMLM_CLIM
    v3.2.h : + NCEP CPS + SCV
    v3.3.h : + sas corrections ( NEW_OMEGA_Factor )

